1)Text

Learn:

Text classification
Sentiment
Intent classification
Named Entity Recognition
Topic classification
Toxicity/moderation
Question/answer labeling
Summarization evaluation
LLM response evaluation

Example:

"How can I reset my password?"
Intent → Password_Reset

2) Image
Learn:
Classification
Bounding box
Polygon
Semantic segmentation
Instance segmentation
Keypoints
OCR
Image quality assessment

Example:
Image contains:

🚗 Car
🚶 Person
🚲 Bicycle

You may need to draw bounding boxes around each object.

3) Audio / Voice

Learn:
Transcription
Speaker identification
Speaker diarization
Timestamping
Emotion classification
Noise classification
Intent
Pronunciation/accent-related labeling where the task requires it

Example:
00:00–00:04 Speaker 1:
"I want to cancel my order."

00:04–00:07 Speaker 2:
"Sure, I can help you."

4)  Video

Learn:
Object tracking
Action recognition
Event detection
Frame-level labeling
Temporal segmentation
Object persistence
Human activity recognition

Example:
0–3 sec    Person enters room
3–7 sec    Person picks up bottle
7–10 sec   Person drinks water
